  "text_pages": [
    "Exchange Program\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n｜International｜Ryukoku University  You, Unlimited\nNeed Help?\nCenter for the Promotion of Global Education\nExchange Program\nRyukoku Japan Studies Program (JSP)\n＜From April 2026＞\nJapanese Experience Program in Kyoto (JEP Kyoto)\n＜Until March 2026＞\nApplication Form\nStudent Life at Ryukoku University\nStarting in the 2026 Academic Year, the Exchange Student program \"Japanese Experience Program in Kyoto (JEP Kyoto)\" will be reorganized into the \"Ryukoku Japan Studies Program (JSP).\" This new program will be rebuilt as a more practical and in-depth experience, with themes such as \"Kyoto,\" \"Buddhism,\" and \"Magokoro (Sincerity)”. For more details, please refer to the program link above.\nPagetop"
  ],
